            score += 2.0 * frac * (1.0 + x);
        }
    }

    // MUTATION (gen 21): residual-absorbability term — if the post-residual
    // can hold the next item with a leftover that is itself reusable
    // (exactly zero or >= half the next item), reward it; scaled by
    // competition among bins. Combined with an awkward-fraction pressure
    // that penalizes residuals at odd fractions of capacity mid-stream.
